# Trial-Size Trial by Fire (outlands 15) at Dodmos with Trial by Fire (outlands 12, a lookup quest on C#) accepted: Trial
# by Fire's 272 (an Event-priority action) alternates with Dodmos's script (UseFallback), so the script's turns show this
# quest's arms against Trial by Fire's. A level 20 Summoner at Windurst fame level 2, both quests accepted by GM, no Mini
# Tuning Fork of Fire: 272, then the script's 290 (0, fork, 0, 20), finished on 1 (a new fork), then 272, then the
# script's 272 (the fork held). Then this quest completed by GM: 272, then the script's 289. The fork's trade while this
# quest is completed: nothing.
char zone=Kazham pos=100.37,-13.999,-97.676 job=SMN lvl=20
fame Windurst 50
quest Outlands.TrialByFire accepted
quest Outlands.TrialSizeTrialByFire accepted
login
trigger Dodmos                            # Trial by Fire's 272
finish
trigger Dodmos                            # the script: accepted, no fork: 290 (0, fork, 0, 20)
finish option=1                           # a new Mini Tuning Fork of Fire, ITEM_OBTAINED
trigger Dodmos                            # Trial by Fire's 272
finish
trigger Dodmos                            # the script: accepted, the fork held: 272 (this quest's)
finish
quest Outlands.TrialSizeTrialByFire completed
trigger Dodmos                            # Trial by Fire's 272
finish
trigger Dodmos                            # the script: completed: 289
finish
trade Dodmos MiniTuningForkOfFire x1      # completed: nothing
